OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1786643328
OL,3,CTwo arrested after bomb squad destroy
OL,4,Cpotential explosives
OL,6,FOfficers have now confirmed that
OL,7,Fpotential explosives - believed to
OL,8,Fhave been used to make homemade
OL,9,Ffireworks - were recovered from the
OL,10,Fproperty and subsequently destroyed.
OL,12,FA 71-year-old man and a 46-year-old
OL,13,Fman were arrested on suspicion of
OL,14,Fmanufacturing ammunition without a
OL,15,Flicence.
OL,17,FDurham Constabulary have said they
OL,18,Fremain in custody on Wednesday while
OL,19,Fenquiries continue.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/3
